{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946790/extras/a86c499e91274d0eb710d48703909a2b.avif?t=1755884649\" width=616 height=90 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick a spot, drop a pixel, and see what happens. Thousands of people are painting on the same grid, shaping and reshaping it in real time. Every mark counts, whether it\u2019s part of a huge mural or just a single dot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946790/extras/7c0681c6d968d72dd74af2a40544e0d9.avif?t=1755884649\" width=616 height=66 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc40 Watch the canvas change live as others draw alongside you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u23f3 Place a pixel, wait for your timer, then go again - planning matters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd1d Join friends or public groups to defend your space or build something bigger.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f Fight for territory, collaborate on art, or quietly slip in your own design.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946790/extras/db35991080dbe1c3d63b29f6352b00f5.avif?t=1755884649\" width=616 height=66 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The grid is open. Will you create, defend, or destroy?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3946790?t=1755884649","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946790/7e31cfe2c295ddd810ac70d383227bf9d56140fa/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=17558846